./  (the whole module except internal/)
    Origin:     etcd raft, go.etcd.io/raft/v3, branch main at
                commit 638f42739b77572b5708eb0d8a776a272ade71ed
                (v3.7.0-rc.0.0.20261009205358-638f42739b77), which holds
                every change of tag v3.7.0; https://github.com/etcd-io/raft
    Copyright:  The etcd Authors
    License:    LICENSE
    Changes:
      - Import paths rewritten from go.etcd.io/raft/v3 to this module, and
        raftpb's go_package with them (raft.proto, and the descriptor in
        raft.pb.go, whose code is otherwise protoc-gen-go's).
      - Fixes to safety, linearizable reads and liveness, validation of
        messages from peers, and additions to the API (Config.ElectionRand,
        ValidateMessage, ValidateConfChange). FORK.md lists and explains
        each one.
      - Tests use internal/testutil in place of github.com/stretchr/testify,
        and internal/datadriven in place of github.com/cockroachdb/datadriven.
      - Repository plumbing was removed or replaced: CI configuration,
        Makefile, scripts, tools, OWNERS, code-of-conduct.md,
        .golangci.yaml and .go-version. README.md was renamed to
        UPSTREAM-README.md.

internal/datadriven/  (used by tests only)
    Origin:     github.com/cockroachdb/datadriven
                v1.0.3
    Copyright:  The Cockroach Authors
    License:    internal/datadriven/LICENSE
    Changes:    The github.com/pmezard/go-difflib dependency was replaced
                by diff.go, which uses only the standard library.

internal/testutil/  (used by tests only)
    Written by the raftseg authors. Its API and failure behaviour follow
    github.com/stretchr/testify (MIT), so that the upstream tests run
    unchanged. No testify code is included. testdata/testifycompat
    compares the two directly.

Dependencies (not included)
    google.golang.org/protobuf v1.36.12, Google's protobuf runtime
    (BSD 3-Clause), which raftpb's generated code requires.
